      "value": "While I doubt this feature will get implemented because it makes no logical sense to have a mouth move with voice muted, I think you can achieve the same effect by sliding the mic volume to 0 rather than muting the microphone. Mouth should still move but no voice can be heard, unless that has been fixed already.",
